  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "The tangent and normal to the ellipse <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math> at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> meet the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>, respectively. Then the area (in sq. units) of the triangle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></math> is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "2au7b",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>68</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "puiHA",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s8prG",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "nWRfV",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>34</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
